3. THIRD-PARTY PAPERS  —  NOT LICENSED HERE, AND NOT INCLUDED
   ----------------------------------------------------------
   The five audited papers are not redistributed in this repository, and neither
   is our extracted text of them. They remain under whatever terms their
   publishers and authors set.

   SOURCES.md gives each paper's canonical URL together with the SHA-256 of the
   PDF we read and of the text we extracted, so that anyone can obtain their own
   copy and confirm it is byte-identical to ours.

   Short quotations from those papers appear in the report and the audits, each
   bound to its source and each verified mechanically against the original text
   by quotecheck.py.
